OL,3,GNEWSAMan found guilty of murdering
OL,4,Astranger in flat
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who stabbed a stranger to death
OL,7,Fat a block of flats in a "senseless,
OL,8,Fbrutal act of violence" has been
OL,9,Fconvicted of murder.
OL,11,FLeon Douglas stabbed 40-year-old Khalid
OL,12,FMarchoud in the abdomen at a
OL,13,Fninth-floor flat in Tollgate Gardens in
OL,14,FMaida Vale, north-west London, on the
OL,15,Fevening of 19 December.
OL,17,FWitnesses told his trial at Harrow
OL,18,FCrown Court how 45-year-old Douglas
OL,19,Fdemanded entry by shouting through a
OL,20,Fletterbox, and was immediately
OL,21,Faggressive.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
