OL,3,GNEWSAMan found guilty of murdering
OL,4,Astranger in flat
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met Police said the killer tried to
OL,7,Fevade arrest by disposing of the
OL,8,Fclothes he had been wearing, dyeing his
OL,9,Fhair red and shaving his beard to alter
OL,10,Fhis appearance. Douglas will be
OL,11,Fsentenced on Friday.
